{
  "_comment": "Street events: timed open-world incidents rolled during free roam. schedule.intervalSeconds: free-roam time between event rolls ([min, max], 8-12 minutes); the timer only runs on the street or rooftops with no heist, race or battle on. An event is eligible when your Street Cred >= requiredStreetCred, it's off cooldown, no event of its type is running and one of its zones is within schedule.spawnDistance of you; one is picked by spawnWeight. durationSeconds: how long it stays up once spawned. policeStarsOnTrigger: the Wanted Level you get the moment you engage (hit the truck, fight at the drop, get near it); 0 = no police hook. rewards: cash range, items (each rolled by chance), upgradeChips (a permanent boost to every car you drive, max upgradeChips.max), streetCred (global) and regionalCred (in the zone's district). After an event completes or expires, lingerSeconds of grace, then everything it put in the world is removed. Zones are world metres (x east, z south); rooftop zones have the roof height y; depots are the armored trucks' start and end points; generated from the city layout by scripts/gen-event-zones.ts.",
